@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000
@adminEmail = admin@mostrador.test
@adminPassword = Admin-dev-2026!
@ownerEmail = dueno@local3.test
@ownerPassword = Dueno-dev-2026!
@token = {{login.response.body.$.access_token}}
@tenantId = {{created.response.body.$.tenant_id}}
@ownerToken = {{ownerLogin.response.body.$.access_token}}

# Flujo sin semilla: requiere solo `db:apply`. Ejecutar en orden.
# El contexto admin se elige con el encabezado X-Tenant-Slug: admin (o el Host admin.localhost).

### 1. Primer registro en admin: queda como root (201). Si ya hay root: 403 ADMIN_ALREADY_EXISTS
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/register
X-Tenant-Slug: admin
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "{{adminEmail}}", "password": "{{adminPassword}}", "first_name": "Admin", "last_name": "Plataforma" }

### 2. Segundo registro en admin con otro email (403 ADMIN_ALREADY_EXISTS)
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/register
X-Tenant-Slug: admin
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "otro@mostrador.test", "password": "{{adminPassword}}", "first_name": "Otro", "last_name": "Usuario" }

### 3. Login del root (guarda el token)
# @name login
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "{{adminEmail}}", "password": "{{adminPassword}}" }

### 4. Sesion en admin: tenant null, stores [], permisos tenants:*, is_root true
GET {{baseUrl}}/me
X-Tenant-Slug: admin
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 5. Rutas con tenant en admin (404 TENANT_NOT_FOUND)
GET {{baseUrl}}/stores
X-Tenant-Slug: admin
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 6. El dueno se registra primero (sin X-Tenant-Slug admin: usuario comun, sin tenant)
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "{{ownerEmail}}", "password": "{{ownerPassword}}", "first_name": "Dueno", "last_name": "Local3" }

### 7. Alta de tenant con su primer local y el dueno (201). Slug repetido: 409 SLUG_TAKEN
# @name created
POST {{baseUrl}}/tenants
X-Tenant-Slug: admin
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Local Tres",
  "slug": "local3",
  "store": { "name": "Centro", "slug": "centro", "address": "Av. Siempre Viva 742" },
  "owner_email": "{{ownerEmail}}"
}

### 8. Dueno no registrado (404 USER_NOT_FOUND)
POST {{baseUrl}}/tenants
X-Tenant-Slug: admin
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Local Cuatro", "slug": "local4", "store": { "name": "Norte", "slug": "norte" }, "owner_email": "nadie@local4.test" }

### 9. Slug reservado (400 INVALID_SLUG)
POST {{baseUrl}}/tenants
X-Tenant-Slug: admin
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Reservado", "slug": "admin", "store": { "name": "Norte", "slug": "norte" }, "owner_email": "{{ownerEmail}}" }

### 10. Listado de tenants
GET {{baseUrl}}/tenants
X-Tenant-Slug: admin
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 11. Renombrar y suspender (el slug no se edita)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/tenants/{{tenantId}}
X-Tenant-Slug: admin
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Local Tres SRL", "is_active": false }

### 12. Tenant suspendido (404 TENANT_NOT_FOUND)
GET {{baseUrl}}/me
X-Tenant-Slug: local3
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 13. Reactivar
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/tenants/{{tenantId}}
X-Tenant-Slug: admin
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "is_active": true }

### 14. PATCH vacio (400 EMPTY_UPDATE)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/tenants/{{tenantId}}
X-Tenant-Slug: admin
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### 15. El root opera cualquier tenant: sesion en local3 (tenant y locales, is_root true)
GET {{baseUrl}}/me
X-Tenant-Slug: local3
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 16. Login del dueno y su sesion en local3
# @name ownerLogin
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "{{ownerEmail}}", "password": "{{ownerPassword}}" }

###
GET {{baseUrl}}/me
X-Tenant-Slug: local3
Authorization: Bearer {{ownerToken}}

### 17. El dueno no administra tenants (403 NOT_A_MEMBER en admin)
GET {{baseUrl}}/tenants
X-Tenant-Slug: admin
Authorization: Bearer {{ownerToken}}
